ass=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hom.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">13.495</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.38</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἑοῖ αὐτῇ</span> used of the <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1</span> </span> pers., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.R.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.99</span> </span>: for <span class=\"gk\">ϝίν, ἵν</span>, v. ἵ: <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Boeot.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">ἑΐν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Corinn.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">36</span> </span>: acc. <span class=\"gk\">ἕ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.497</span> </span>, al., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">O.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.14</span> </span>, enclit. <span class=\"gk\">ἑ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.236</span> </span>, al., never in Trag., Com., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> </span>, or <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> </span>, but found in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Smp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">175a</span> </span>,al.; <span class=\"gk\">ἑέ</span> twice in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hom.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20.171</span> </span>,